      <title>COP31: Climate Summit Fails When It Can’t Even Say ‘Fossil Fuels’</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-22/cop31-climate-summit-fails-when-it-can-t-even-say-fossil-fuels</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">d70a4d59eaaa378b1269f10b</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:45:42 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>The 31st United Nations climate conference was expected to be a fairly dull affair, focusing on “implementation.” Instead, it will be one for the history books as a dramatic final showdown failed to result in an agreement for only the second time since climate COPs began in 1995.</description>
